WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.232
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:12.233 --> 00:00:15.257
I'm a raccoon.

3
00:00:15.258 --> 00:00:19.153
Raccoons are small mammals.

4
00:00:19.154 --> 00:00:21.693
Where do you live?

5
00:00:21.694 --> 00:00:26.520
A lot of raccoons live in North America.

6
00:00:26.521 --> 00:00:32.251
We live in forests, marshes, and cities.

7
00:00:32.252 --> 00:00:36.993
We usually make dens high in trees.

8
00:00:36.994 --> 00:00:40.184
Are you wearing a mask?

9
00:00:40.185 --> 00:00:44.721
No, that's just my fur.

10
00:00:44.722 --> 00:00:49.552
We also have rings on our tails.

11
00:00:49.553 --> 00:00:52.789
What do you eat?

12
00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:57.316
Raccoons eat almost anything.

13
00:00:57.317 --> 00:01:04.548
We love fish, berries, mice, and frogs.

14
00:01:04.549 --> 00:01:08.937
Is it hard to find food in cities?

15
00:01:08.938 --> 00:01:12.625
Not for a raccoon!

16
00:01:12.626 --> 00:01:18.063
We find great food in garbage cans.

17
00:01:18.064 --> 00:01:22.019
You can open garbage cans?

18
00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:26.235
Our front paws are like your hands.

19
00:01:26.236 --> 00:01:30.940
We have five fingers on each paw.

20
00:01:30.941 --> 00:01:36.417
We can grab things and even open doors.

21
00:01:36.418 --> 00:01:40.326
Do you live with other raccoons?

22
00:01:40.327 --> 00:01:45.229
Yes, raccoons live in small groups.

23
00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:49.322
We sleep during the day.

24
00:01:49.323 --> 00:01:55.753
We look for food at night.

25
00:01:55.754 --> 00:02:00.777
Oh! I smell food in that garbage can.

26
00:02:00.778 --> 00:02:03.920
See you later.

27
00:02:03.921 --> 00:02:11.668
Good-bye, Raccoon!

